                            "settings": {
                                "html": "<div class='approach-wrap'>\n  <div class='approach-head'>\n    <div class='approach-head-text'>\n      <span class='approach-label'>Our Approach</span>\n      <h2>What makes<br /><i>Stillness different</i></h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class='approach-head-desc'>\n      <p>We don't offer classes. We offer experiences. There's a difference &mdash; and you'll feel it the moment you walk in.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class='approach-grid-container'>\n    <div class='approach-grid'>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>01</div>\n        <h3>Experiential, not educational</h3>\n        <p>You don't leave knowing more. You leave feeling different. Every session is designed to create a real, physical shift &mdash; not just a mental one.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>02</div>\n        <h3>Led by someone in it</h3>\n        <p>Our founder isn't teaching from a textbook. She's facilitating from lived experience. That's not a marketing line. You'll feel it in the room.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>03</div>\n        <h3>Honest, not mystical</h3>\n        <p>We skip the jargon. No toxic positivity. No pressure to \"transform.\" Just a real space where you can slow down and feel what's actually there.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>04</div>\n        <h3>Rooted in community</h3>\n        <p>We're a Vancouver company. Our sessions are intimate. Our community is real. We're not a platform &mdash; we're a place.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>05</div>\n        <h3>A safe container</h3>\n        <p>Everything we create is designed to help you feel held. You don't need to be ready. You just need to show up.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>06</div>\n        <h3>Generational thinking</h3>\n        <p>We work with adults. And we build tools for children. Because healing is more powerful when it starts early.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.approach-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.approach-head {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 64px;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin-bottom: 80px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .approach-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n}\n.approach-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3em !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    color: #688F9D !important;\n    margin-bottom: 24px !important;\n}\n.approach-head-text h2 {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 48px !important;\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    line-height: 1.2 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .approach-head-text h2 { font-size: 36px !important; }\n}\n.approach-head-desc p {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 18px !important;\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    line-height: 1.625 !important;\n    color: rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.7) !important;\n}\n\n.approach-grid-container {\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2) !important;\n    background: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2) !important;\n}\n.approach-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.5px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .approach-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .approach-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n.approach-card {\n    background: #FFFFFF !important;\n    padding: 48px !important;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    transition: background 0.5s ease !important;\n}\n.approach-card:hover {\n    background: #D9E8EB !important;\n}\n.ap-num {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 48px !important;\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    color: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.4) !important;\n    margin-bottom: 24px !important;\n}\n.approach-card h3 {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    margin: 0 0 16px !important;\n}\n.approach-card p {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 15.2px !important; /* 0.95rem */\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    line-height: 1.625 !important;\n    color: rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.7) !important;\n}\n</style>"
